# Atlas Core Component Design Tokens Specification
**Author:** Pixel Reyes  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D16 07:05  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Cost-optimized component token system for Atlas Core, standardizing UI primitives and semantic mappings to minimize bundle bloat and design handoff overhead, aligned with Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Pixel Reyes",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "strategy": "Cost Cutter / Lean Architecture",
    "references": {
      "source": "Business Document: Company Document",
      "usage": "Extracted brand baseline color values, service-tier visual constraints, and accessibility requirements to prevent redundant palette expansions and reduce component variant overhead."
    }
  },
  "global": {
    "color": {
      "brand-primary": { "value": "#0F4C81", "type": "color" },
      "brand-neutral-dark": { "value": "#1A1A1A", "type": "color" },
      "brand-neutral-light": { "value": "#F4F5F7", "type": "color" },
      "brand-success": { "value": "#107C41", "type": "color" },
      "brand-warning": { "value": "#D83B01", "type": "color" }
    },
    "spacing": {
      "unit-xs": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" },
      "unit-sm": { "value": "8px", "type": "dimension" },
      "unit-md": { "value": "16px", "type": "dimension" },
      "unit-lg": { "value": "24px", "type": "dimension" }
    },
    "radius": {
      "default": { "value": "4px", "type": "dimension" }
    }
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "padding-y": { "value": "{global.spacing.unit-sm.value}" },
      "padding-x": { "value": "{global.spacing.unit-md.value}" },
      "radius": { "value": "{global.radius.default.value}" },
      "primary-bg": { "value": "{global.color.brand-primary.value}" },
      "primary-text": { "value": "#FFFFFF" },
      "secondary-bg": { "value": "{global.color.brand-neutral-light.value}" },
      "secondary-text": { "value": "{global.color.brand-neutral-dark.value}" }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface-bg": { "value": "#FFFFFF" },
      "border": { "value": "1px solid {global.color.brand-neutral-light.value}" },
      "padding": { "value": "{global.spacing.unit-md.value}" }
    }
  }
}
```